      "refersTo": "button-stop",
      "description": "Stop appearance beside an active or unresolved run. Static, non-actuating preview.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-stop\" type=\"button\">Stop run</button>",
      "css": ".ds-stop{font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.5;transition:background .16s ease-out,color .16s ease-out;width:100%;border:1px solid #b3261e;color:#a61b14;background:white;padding:12px;border-radius:7px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}.ds-stop:hover:not(:disabled){background:#edf1f6}.ds-stop:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#1a73e8);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-stop:disabled{opacity:.55;cursor:not-allowed}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-stop{min-height:44px}} @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-stop{transition:none!important}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Task field",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "input",
      "description": "Labeled native task entry; mobile text size increases for readable editing.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-task-label\">Task<textarea class=\"ds-task\" rows=\"3\" maxlength=\"4000\" placeholder=\"Describe the object and the result you want…\"></textarea></label>",
      "css": ".ds-task-label{font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.5;display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink,#202124)}.ds-task{font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.5;display:block;width:100%;margin-top:7px;padding:11px;border:1px solid #bdc1c6;border-radius:6px;background:white;color:var(--ink,#202124);font-size:14px;font-weight:400;resize:vertical;caret-color:var(--blue,#174ea6)}.ds-task::placeholder{color:#687078}.ds-task:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#1a73e8);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-task:disabled{cursor:not-allowed}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-task{font-size:16px}} @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-task,.ds-task-label{transition:none!important}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Main navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "navigation",
      "description": "Quiet page navigation; the current page has a pale blue wash.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><button class=\"ds-nav-item\" type=\"button\" aria-current=\"page\">Workspace</button><button class=\"ds-nav-item\" type=\"button\">Runs</button><button class=\"ds-nav-item\" type=\"button\">Method &amp; evidence</button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap}.ds-nav-item{font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.5;transition:background .16s ease-out,color .16s ease-out;font-size:14px;border:0;border-radius:6px;padding:10px 12px;background:none;color:var(--ink,#202124);cursor:pointer}.ds-nav-item:hover{background:#edf1f6}.ds-nav-item[aria-current]{background:#e8f0fe;color:var(--blue,#174ea6)}.ds-nav-item:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#1a73e8);outline-offset:3px;}@media(max-width:1050px){.ds-nav{gap:0}.ds-nav-item{padding:10px}}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-nav{width:100%;gap:10px}.ds-nav-item{border-radius:4px 4px 0 0;padding:10px 8px;min-height:44px}} @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-nav,.ds-nav-item{transition:none!important}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Camera selection",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "camera-tab",
      "description": "Actual camera-selection control, using pressed semantics rather than a decorative tag.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-views\" aria-label=\"Camera selection\"><button class=\"ds-view\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Overhead</button><button class=\"ds-view\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Left wrist</button><button class=\"ds-view\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Right wrist</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-views{display:flex;gap:3px;flex-wrap:wrap}.ds-view{font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.5;transition:background .16s ease-out,color .16s ease-out;font-size:12px;padding:8px 11px;border:0;border-radius:6px;background:none;color:var(--ink,#202124);cursor:pointer}.ds-view:hover{background:#edf1f6}.ds-view[aria-pressed=true]{background:#e8f0fe;color:var(--blue,#174ea6)}.ds-view:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#1a73e8);outline-offset:3px;}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-view{min-height:44px;padding:9px 10px}} @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-view,.ds-views{transition:none!important}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Run panel",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "run-panel",
      "description": "Flat pale surface grouping task and runtime controls.",
      "html": "<aside class=\"ds-panel\"><h2 class=\"ds-panel-title\">Run RoboHarness</h2><p class=\"ds-panel-intro\">Describe a task for the selected station.</p><div class=\"ds-panel-status\" role=\"status\"><strong>Runtime not ready</strong><p>Waiting for the verified control release and model service. No run is submitted by connecting.</p></div></aside>",
      "css": ".ds-panel{font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.5;background:var(--paper,#f8f9fa);color:var(--ink,#202124);border-radius:var(--radius,12px);padding:24px}.ds-panel-title{margin:0;font-size:19px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:600}.ds-panel-intro{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted,#5d6269);margin:6px 0 24px}.ds-panel-status{font-size:12px}.ds-panel-status strong{font-weight:600;color:var(--warning,#8b4e0a)}.ds-panel-status p{margin:4px 0 0;color:var(--muted,#5d6269)}@media(max-width:1050px){.ds-panel{padding:20px}}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-panel{padding:22px}.ds-panel-status{font-size:13px}} @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-panel,.ds-panel-intro,.ds-panel-status,.ds-panel-title{transition:none!important}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Camera stage",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "camera-stage",
      "description": "Camera shell in its genuine first-frame waiting state. No replacement image is included.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-stage\"><div class=\"ds-stage-top\"><span>YAM1 · Overhead</span><span>Latest published frames</span></div><div class=\"ds-image-well\"><div class=\"ds-camera-empty\"><p>Connecting to the robot camera…</p><span>Fetching the latest published image.</span></div></div><div class=\"ds-stage-bottom\">Waiting for first frame</div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-stage{font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.5;background:var(--stage,#202124);color:var(--stage-ink,#f1f3f4);border-radius:var(--radius,12px);overflow:hidden}.ds-stage-top,.ds-stage-bottom{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:15px;padding:13px 17px;font-size:12px;color:var(--stage-muted,#c4c7cb)}.ds-stage-top>span:first-child{color:var(--stage-ink,#f1f3f4)}.ds-image-well{position:relative;aspect-ratio:16/9;max-width:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:#171819}.ds-image-well img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;display:block}.ds-camera-empty{text-align:center;padding:35px 20px}.ds-camera-empty p{margin:0;font-size:15px}.ds-camera-empty span{display:block;font-size:12px;max-width:40ch;margin:8px auto 0;color:var(--stage-muted,#c4c7cb)}.ds-stage-bottom{min-height:44px;padding-top:6px;padding-bottom:6px;align-items:center}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-stage-top{padding:11px 12px;font-size:11px}.ds-stage-top>span:last-child{font-size:10px}.ds-stage-bottom{padding:5px 10px;font-size:10px}} @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-camera-empty,.ds-image-well,.ds-stage,.ds-stage-bottom,.ds-stage-top{transition:none!important}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Image-point inspection",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "inspection-panel",
      "description": "Numeric keyboard path for native image pixels; the preview neither grounds 3D points nor commands motion.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-inspection\"><p>Click the frozen image to inspect pixel coordinates. These points have no depth or robot coordinates yet and do not command motion.</p><form class=\"ds-pixel-form\"><label class=\"ds-pixel-label\">Pixel X<input class=\"ds-pixel\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\"></label><label class=\"ds-pixel-label\">Pixel Y<input class=\"ds-pixel\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\"></label><button class=\"ds-add-point\" type=\"button\">Add point</button></form><p class=\"ds-point-list\">No points selected.</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-inspection{font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.5;padding:16px;background:var(--paper,#f8f9fa);border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted,#5d6269)}.ds-inspection p{margin:0}.ds-pixel-form{display:flex;align-items:end;gap:12px;margin-top:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}.ds-pixel-label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px}.ds-pixel{font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.5;width:100px;padding:9px;border:1px solid #bdc1c6;border-radius:6px;background:white;color:var(--ink,#202124);font-size:15px;caret-color:var(--blue,#174ea6)}.ds-add-point{font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.5;transition:background .16s ease-out,color .16s ease-out;margin:0;padding:9px 13px;border:1px solid #b6bec8;border-radius:6px;font-size:13px;background:transparent;color:var(--blue,#174ea6);cursor:pointer}.ds-add-point:hover{background:#edf1f6}.ds-pixel:focus-visible,.ds-add-point:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#1a73e8);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-point-list{margin-top:10px!important}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-pixel{font-size:16px;min-height:44px}.ds-add-point{min-height:44px}} @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-add-point,.ds-inspection,.ds-pixel,.ds-pixel-form,.ds-pixel-label,.ds-point-list{transition:none!important}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Persistent launch progress",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "run-panel",
      "description": "Unresolved-submission state. Static component preview with no fabricated timestamps or execution record.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-launch\" role=\"status\" aria-label=\"Launch progress\"><strong>Submission unresolved</strong><p>The original request may have been accepted. Refresh preserves this state; use Stop and wait for verified status before another Run.</p></div>",
      "css": ".ds-launch{font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.5;border-top:1px solid var(--line,#dadddf);padding-top:14px;margin-top:16px;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink,#202124)}.ds-launch>strong{font-weight:600}.ds-launch>p{color:var(--muted,#5d6269);margin:6px 0}.ds-launch dl{margin:10px 0 0}.ds-launch dl>div{display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:5px}.ds-launch dt{color:var(--muted,#5d6269)}.ds-launch dd{margin:0;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap} @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-launch{transition:none!important}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Robot Workspace",
    "overview": "RoboHarness inherits BluPe’s functional Operate vocabulary: quiet Arial typography, a white workspace, restrained blue controls and a charcoal camera stage. The actual camera image carries the visual weight; surrounding surfaces help a researcher observe the station and make a deliberate next action.\n\nControls are plain and specific. Task entry, editable runner details, approach, planning model and execution mode remain distinct. Persistent inline explanations describe the current condition, its cause and the available recovery action. Status text, timestamps and actual events carry meaning; decoration does not imply physical readiness or progress.\n\nThe interface uses flat tonal grouping and short color transitions. It has no decorative animation or progress percentage. Empty, interrupted, uncertain and unverified states stay visible in the same calm visual language as the operational workspace.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Actual, uncropped camera imagery leads the workspace.",
      "Blue marks actions, focus and selection; text explains state.",
      "Flat white and pale-gray surfaces group controls without shadows.",
      "Persistent inline status and event timestamps make waits inspectable."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The State in Words Rule",
        "body": "Pair every status color with explicit text; an available-station dot is not proof that the runtime can execute.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Plain Type Rule",
        "body": "Use the incumbent sans hierarchy for controls and explanations; reserve monospace for pixel coordinates and recorded structured data.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Full Frame Rule",
        "body": "Contain camera imagery inside the stage; preserve every source pixel and let unused space remain dark.",
        "section": "layout"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Flat Surface Rule",
        "body": "Separate regions with tone, spacing and thin borders; the current system has no shadows.",
        "section": "elevation"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Actual Frame Rule",
        "body": "Inspection freezes the displayed actual frame and labels image pixels; selected points do not imply depth, robot coordinates or motion.",
        "section": "components"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Event Evidence Rule",
        "body": "Show lifecycle labels and timestamps only from the corresponding observed runtime events; a fixture is not an execution record.",
        "section": "components"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do keep actual footage uncropped and distinguish captured time from received time.",
      "Do keep inline cause and recovery text visible beside non-ready, interrupted and unresolved states.",
      "Do preserve keyboard focus, native form controls and the mobile touch-target minimum.",
      "Do show runner attribution separately from approach, underlying model and execution mode.",
      "Do retain honest empty history and unavailable-recording states until matching RoboHarness evidence exists.",
      "Do treat the sidecar tonal ramps as derived swatch previews; the extracted frontmatter values remain the implemented palette."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don’t substitute mock imagery, unrelated historical footage or decorative progress for the selected station’s actual state.",
      "Don’t present image-point inspection as 3D grounding or a command to the robot.",
      "Don’t equate execution completion with successful object outcome; the footage must be assessed.",
      "Don’t use color alone to communicate readiness, error, selection or availability.",
      "Don’t publish private runner email in examples, public evidence or design-system snippets.",
      "Don’t extend this integration’s design decisions into the parent meeting experiment’s PRODUCT.md or DESIGN.md."
    ]
  }
}
